2. go-ios, https://github.com/danielpaulus/go-ios, commit 273d3e06e803fb6ee95e4df914d8be82c5ee4bb0
   Followed (behaviour, field names): ios/instruments/devicestate.go (the ConditionInducer group fields, the 120 s
